**Handling data privacy and baseline validation**

I’m figuring out how to send row data hashed locally to avoid exposing sensitive IDs or usernames through logging, while comparing permission changes against a confirmed baseline. I’ll focus on capturing exact personal permissions from the DOM, verifying subjects carefully without printing raw names, and managing temporary baseline files with hashed data only.
